cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Credaryn in a project or publication, please cite it as below."
title: "Credaryn: trust infrastructure for verifiable documents"
abstract: >-
  Open-source, standards-first infrastructure for issuing and verifying authentic
  business documents across controlled digital PDF and physical paper. Credaryn
  composes PAdES, COSE/CBOR, X.509/PKI and W3C Verifiable Credentials behind one
  developer API and one normalized verification result.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ranjeet-h/credaryn"
url: "https://ranjeet-h.github.io/credaryn/"
issues: "https://github.com/ranjeet-h/credaryn/issues"
keywords:
  - verifiable-documents
  - pades
  - cose
  - cbor
  - verifiable-credentials
  - pki
  - kms
  - hsm
  - qr
